<title>SINGAPORE: Elec shares suspended for placement.</title>
<headline>Elec shares suspended for placement.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Printed circuit board maker Elec &amp; Eltek International Co Ltd requested supension of its shares pending an announcement of a proposed placement, a company statement said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the placement was by its Hong Kong parent Elec &amp; Eltek International Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>It gave no details of the placement. The company's shares in Hong Kong were suspended earlier on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
